      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d54d1c3e31018cde",
      "translationZh": "今天我在 llm-bench.io 上对 Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b-oQ8e-mtp 跑了几次测试：在配备 64 GB 内存的 M5 Max 上使用 oMLX，开启思考并设为 xhigh，上下文窗口为 262k。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8445ed6aa559a1ab",
      "translationZh": "Swift 1.5 与基础版 Qwen3.8 27B 最大的区别在于输出量。每轮完整测试（智能体工作流、代码生成、研究、角色扮演）中，Swift 平均生成 51k 个词元，Qwen3.8 平均生成 77k 个词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb96675585a3ff0d",
      "translationZh": "场景 Swift 1.5 Qwen 3.8 27B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83fcfc54a18428f6",
      "translationZh": "完整基准测试的运行时长：Swift 1.5 平均为 24 分钟，基础版 Qwen 3.8 27B 平均为 38 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2415b3860db139d7",
      "translationZh": "其他方面基本相同：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a1db137469cc9d0",
      "translationZh": "生成速度：34.6 对比 32.8 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6794fe50b5bbbc4",
      "translationZh": "提示词处理：两者均为约 400 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f2d722507241d225",
      "translationZh": "质量评分（该网站的 LLM 评判模型）：85.8 对比 85.0。我跑的四轮测试得分介于 84.3 到 87.2 之间，因此完全处于 LLM 评判模型的预期波动范围内。我认为可以算作平局。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a044c6f123816da",
      "translationZh": "Swift 生成的内容中仍有 3/4 是推理，只是比 Qwen 3.8 27B 少一些。输出仍然很实用。我肯定会试着把它当作日常主力用上几天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
